  "text": "The tide sings soft to sandy shores,\nA rhythmic, endless, liquid roar.\nIt pulls the moon, it pushes tides,\nWith secrets deep where silence hides.\n\nThe waves crash down on jagged stone,\nIn foam and spray, they make their own\nA fleeting home, then slip away,\nTo dance upon the light of day.\n\nOh, sea, you hold the world’s desire,\nFueling dreams with salt and fire.\nFrom distant storms to calmest bay,\nYou lead our wandering souls your way.\n\nGUVOVO-FALOVO"
